    "QuickTime 影片" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "QuickTime Movie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RAW · 正在解码高清版本" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW · Decoding full resolution"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RAW 使用系统自带的解码，支持的相机型号以 macOS 为准。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW files use the system decoder; supported camera models depend on macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RAW（ARW、CR3、NEF 等）不能写入文件内部，始终使用旁边的 .xmp。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW files (ARW, CR3, NEF and others) are never changed; their ratings always go in a .xmp file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SVG 无法解析" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can’t parse SVG"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SVG 渲染失败" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SVG rendering failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 会为每种格式各问你一次，共 %lld 次。如果在某一次选择保留原来的应用，就停在那里，剩下的不再询问。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "macOS will ask you once for this format. If you keep the current app, Yilan stops there."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "macOS will ask you once for each format, %lld times in total. If you keep the current app in any of them, Yilan stops there and won’t ask about the rest."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 没有接受这次更改，%@ 仍由 %@ 打开。请稍后再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS didn’t accept the change. %1$@ still opens in %2$@. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "≥%lld 星" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "≥%lld★"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘Z 撤销" : {
      "comment" : "删除后提示条里可以点的链接",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘Z Undo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
